## Visual Studio & .NET Core GitIgnore

# Build results & binaries
[Bb]in/
[Ob]j/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
[Lg]og/
[Lg]ogs/
x64/
x86/

# Visual Studio cache, settings & user files
.vs/
*.user
*.userprefs
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.user.g.cs

# JetBrains Rider / VS Code settings
.idea/
.vscode/*
!*.vscode/settings.json
!*.vscode/tasks.json
!*.vscode/launch.json

# Operating System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini

# User Secrets & Environment overrides (Optional, un-comment if sensitive)
# appsettings.Development.json
# appsettings.Local.json
*.env
*.pem

# Node / Web Frontend assets (if npm/yarn used in future)
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Test and Coverage results
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
